hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"18985","Waki narrated to us, Aban ibn Abdullah al-Bajali narrated to us, my paternal uncles narrated to me, from their grandfather Sakhr ibn Aylah, that some people of Banu Sulaym fled their land when Islam came, so I took it, then they embraced Islam and disputed with me over it to the Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, so he returned it to them, and said: When a man embraces Islam, he has more right to his land and his property."
